  "notes": "Mixed-alignment state (proposal: 'varies'). Fits the early-game counter-terror loop: Pakistani contracts against ISIS-K cells on the afghan_highlands border. India and Pakistan mutually lock out. Close to China (Chinese kit) yet a client of Western-aligned work; mutual defence pact with Saudi Arabia (September 2025). TTP (Pakistani Taliban) and Baloch separatist groups are not in the canonical roster; proposal: represent them under isis_k-style hostile cells or add later.",
